      },
      "text": null,
      "html": "<table><tbody><tr><th>Mon 25th</th><th>Tue 26th</th><th>Wed 27th</th><th>Thu 28th</th><th>Fri 29th</th></tr><tr><td>M White  9.15am-1.30pm</td><td>S Washbourne  9am-1.30pm</td><td>C Smith  8.30am-11.30am</td><td>L Pinner  9am-1.30pm</td><td>D Audino  8.30am-11am  R Nocciolino  10.30am-2pm</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2752993103832986,
        "y0": 0.15308073863847238,
        "x1": 0.6386159101992969,
        "y1": 0.2177829515905675
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24495145858054543,
        "y0": 0.23167446555819474,
        "x1": 0.69864591322224,
        "y1": 0.32481199524940624
      },
      "text": "On Monday 18 th October, approximately 500 members of our Chisholm community gathered to acknowledge some of the wonderful team and individual sporting performances for 2010.  Special guests Ms Shae Bolton (West Coast Fever Netball) and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.250999642743028,
        "y0": 0.32791888361045135,
        "x1": 0.6921078261425961,
        "y1": 0.40020391923990506
      },
      "text": "Mr Trent Mitton (Kookaburras gold medalist at the recent Delhi Commonwealth Games) shared the night with our future sporting stars.  Both were able to offer some advice and inspiration for all who attended.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7027880912428563,
        "y0": 0.13991427025149383,
        "x1": 0.9584382168980496,
        "y1": 0.3640761930415862
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "caption",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7226572043472964,
        "y0": 0.36763881235154394,
        "x1": 0.9435308619376124,
        "y1": 0.39442624703087886
      },
      "text": "Trent with Lara Ameduri and Danika Vidakovich",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.36399988351207796,
        "y0": 0.40323954869358675,
        "x1": 0.8408528353119195,
        "y1": 0.419016270783848
      },
      "text": "Congratulations to all our award winners and in particular",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24868117214740973,
        "y0": 0.4223369358669834,
        "x1": 0.9515487179150635,
        "y1": 0.45671223277909745
      },
      "text": "Justin Skowron who was awarded the 'Peter Tonkin' award for the most outstanding Year 12 sports person.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5017976793473067,
        "y0": 0.45981912114014256,
        "x1": 0.6983818091804781,
        "y1": 0.4755958432304038
      },
      "text": "Well done to all of you.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4485736587174598,
        "y0": 0.4788452494061758,
        "x1": 0.7463660862642281,
        "y1": 0.49462197149643705
      },
      "text": "Mr Andrew Glover, Head of Sport",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.23910763586531864,
        "y0": 0.5162953718824228,
        "x1": 0.9567166361569486,
        "y1": 0.7303516088925178
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.26942728344013445,
        "y0": 0.7432146593397417,
        "x1": 0.34226133101396583,
        "y1": 0.7944856403559234
      },
      "text": null,
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "heading",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4810322470561164,
        "y0": 0.7449260095011877,
        "x1": 0.79454188917979,
        "y1": 0.7770922802850356
      },
      "text": "STUDENT CONGRATULATIONS William Edge Year 11Laurence1",
      "html": null,
      "level": 1,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.27540144495884167,
        "y0": 0.7774530641330165,
        "x1": 0.9099919368635433,
        "y1": 0.8452100950118766
      },
      "text": "William has been selected to represent WA in the upcoming All Australian Basketball Tour to USA. He will participate in several competitions on the West Coast of America and play against some of the best USA College Basketball Teams. The tour takes in LA, San Diego, Las Vegas and Phoenix and will last from 28 th Nov to 23 rd Dec. Well done William and good luck for the Tour. We are very proud of you.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "heading",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2901112336604156,
        "y0": 0.8559048456057007,
        "x1": 0.8948649444184454,
        "y1": 0.8826922802850357
      },
      "text": "HAVE YOUR SAY ON PUBLIC TRANSPORT IN YOUR LOCAL COMMUNITY ADVANCING PERTH'S EASTERN REGION",
      "html": null,
      "level": 1,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2700449714584082,
        "y0": 0.883061187648456,
        "x1": 0.914825151711165,
        "y1": 0.9372191686460808
      },
      "text": "Seven Public Transport Forums are being held across the region during October and November 2010. These forums aim to engage and encourage the community to become more aware of the vision for increased public transport and the options and delivery modes that exist. You can register by contacting Samantha Robshaw on email samantha.robshaw@emrc.org.au",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    }
